                      >
                        Explain this function.
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div
                    class="actions"
                  >
                    <button
                      aria-label="copy"
                      class="action"
                      type="button"
                    >
                      <svg
                        data-content="82bfa716"
